"""
Restaurant Management System
----------------------------
Python 3 + Tkinter (GUI) + SQLite (storage).  No third-party packages needed.

Modules (each opens in its own pop-up window from the main screen):
    1. Menu Management   - add / edit / delete / hide items (559 items pre-loaded)
    2. Take Order        - pick items, quantity in pieces, assign to a table
    3. Order Management  - track status, edit quantities, cancel orders
    4. Table Management  - visual table grid (Free / Occupied / Reserved)
    5. Billing           - GST, discount, payment mode, printable receipt, history
    6. Customer Reviews  - star rating + written feedback

Run:  python restaurant_management_system.py   (single file - nothing else needed)
"""

